repository-code: "https://github.com/civic-interconnect/geo-explorer"
url: "https://civic-interconnect.github.io/geo-explorer/"
license: MIT

abstract: >
  Browser-based geographic visualization software for exploring civic
  boundaries through interactive maps. GeoExplorer displays U.S. state,
  county, and congressional district boundaries and Minnesota voting
  precincts using published GeoJSON datasets from Civic Interconnect.
  The application provides geographic selection, map navigation, and
  dataset-specific controls, including county and legislative district
  filtering for Minnesota precincts. It is implemented in JavaScript
  using Leaflet and published as a static web application on GitHub Pages.

